@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki"

Feature: Koroneiki Product API
	Testing Koroneiki Product API functionality.

Teardown:
	* I tear down the products on koroneiki with the following names
	| Liferay Digital Experience Platform |
	| Liferay Portal                      |
	| Liferay Version 7                   |
	| Liferay Version 6                   |

Scenario: Create and view product
	Koroneiki products created via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a product with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki product with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"

Scenario: Create and view multiple products
	Multiple products created via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a product with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"
	And I create a product with the name "Liferay Portal"
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki product with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki product with the name "Liferay Portal"

Scenario: Update and view product
	Koroneiki products updated via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a product with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"
	And I update a product with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" to have the new name "Liferay Portal"
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki product with the name "Liferay Portal"
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki product with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"

Scenario: Update and view multiple products
	Multiple products updated via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a product with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"
	And I create a product with the name "Liferay Portal"
	And I update a product with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" to have the new name "Liferay Version 7"
	And I update a product with the name "Liferay Portal" to have the new name "Liferay Version 6"
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki product with the name "Liferay Version 7"
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki product with the name "Liferay Version 6"
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki product with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki product with the name "Liferay Portal"

Scenario: Remove product and view
	Koroneiki products removed via API should not be viewable via API.

	Given I create a product with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"
	And I delete a koroneiki product with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"
	Then I should not be able to view a koroneiki product with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"

Scenario: Remove multiple products and view
	Multiple products removed via API should not be viewable via API.`

	Given I create a product with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"
	And I create a product with the name "Liferay Portal"
	And I delete a koroneiki product with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"
	And I delete a koroneiki product with the name "Liferay Portal"
	Then I should not be able to view a koroneiki product with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki product with the name "Liferay Portal"